---
import ResponsiveImage from '@chassis-ui/docs/components/ResponsiveImage.astro'
---

<section id="figma-section" class="home-section bg-evident vh-full">
  <div id="figma-carousel" class="carousel slide">
    <div class="carousel-inner text-center">
      <div class="carousel-item active" data-cx-interval="5000">
        <div class="col-12 col-large-8 offset-large-2">
          <h1 class="section-title">
            <span class="font-normal d-block">Documentation pages</span> for detailed insights
          </h1>
          <p class="section-body">
            Each component file has a documentation page provides comprehensive information on
            variants, properties, specifications, and design tokens. Empower product managers,
            design leads, and engineering teams to enhance projects with clarity and confidence.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 col-large-10 offset-large-1">
          <ResponsiveImage
            imgPath="/static/images/home/figma-docs-light.png"
            alt="Chassis UI"
            classes="image-fluid w-100"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel-item" data-cx-interval="5000">
        <div class="col-8 offset-2">
          <h1 class="section-title">
            <span class="font-normal d-block">Elevate your design</span> with a powerful color system
          </h1>
          <p class="section-body">
            Chassis creates distinct color tokens linked to essential UI elements—text, backgrounds,
            icons, and indicators. With multiple emphasis levels, it ensures a cohesive and visually
            appealing design across all components, making it easier for product managers, design
            leads, and engineering teams to enhance their projects.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-10 offset-1">
          <ResponsiveImage
            imgPath="/static/images/home/figma-tokens-light.png"
            alt="Chassis UI"
            classes="image-fluid w-100"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel-item" data-cx-interval="5000">
        <div class="col-8 offset-2">
          <h1 class="section-title">
            <span class="font-normal d-block">Single-file components</span> with documentation and test
            pages
          </h1>
          <p class="section-body">
            Chassis's Figma library features single-file components that integrate design,
            documentation, and testing. Each component includes a documentation page with
            comprehensive details on variants, properties, specifications, and design tokens, as
            well as a test page for visual regression testing.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-10 offset-1">
          <ResponsiveImage
            imgPath="/static/images/home/figma-library-light.png"
            alt="Chassis UI"
            classes="image-fluid w-100"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <button
      class="button large link carousel-control-prev"
      type="button"
      data-cx-target="#figma-carousel"
      data-cx-slide="prev"
    >
      <svg class="icon"><use xlink:href="#chevron-left-solid"></use></svg>
      <span class="visually-hidden">Previous</span>
    </button>
    <button
      class="button large link carousel-control-next"
      type="button"
      data-cx-target="#figma-carousel"
      data-cx-slide="next"
    >
      <svg class="icon"><use xlink:href="#chevron-right-solid"></use></svg>
      <span class="visually-hidden">Next</span>
    </button>
  </div>
</section>
